{
  "description": "Shared test vectors for the local file handoff: a main-frame navigation to a local file that a browser tab hands to cmux's file opener instead of loading. A CEF tab hands off Markdown (the markdown page) and the video and audio its build cannot decode (H.264/HEVC .mp4 .mov .m4v and AAC .m4a .aac; the fork builds without proprietary codecs), which open in a WebKit tab; a WebKit tab hands off Markdown only. Swift LocalFileHandoff (CmuxNextBrowser/Core/LocalFileHandoff.swift, LocalFileHandoffVectorTests) and C++ CEFHandsOffLocalFile (CEFShim/src/local_file_handoff.h, scripts/cmux-next/test-local-file-handoff-cpp.sh) both read this file. Change both together.",
